* AGENT
  * Run `ssh-add` to load keys into the agent
    * Ideally once the yubikey is plugged in
    * If you don't get a GUI prompt on attempting ssh, re-run this command
  * Run `ssh-add -l` to list keys in agent

* COMMON USAGES
  * `ssh -A -L 1234:localhost:5678` forwards the ssh agent and maps port 1234 on
    the local machine to port 5678 on the remote machine

* TERMINAL BREAKAGE
  * if your ssh session ends and breaks the terminal press `v` to edit the
    command line in nvim, insert `reset`, and `:wq`
